=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Mamaulabion} at (G-6) in {z:Norg} to activate the quest (this does not need to be done before obtaining the seven items).
* Obtain the following seven items by selecting them as your reward after defeating the seven avatars below in the battles listed below
** {q:Trial by Fire|Trial by Fire|Trial by Fire} ({p:Ifrit}): {@i:Egil's Torch|1203} {i:Egil's Torch|Egil's Torch|1203}
** {q:Trial by Ice|Trial by Ice|Trial by Ice} ({p:Shiva}): {@i:Rust 'B' Gone|1207} {i:Rust 'B' Gone|Rust 'B' Gone|1207}
** {q:Trial by Wind|Trial by Wind|Trial by Wind} ({p:Garuda}): {@i:Bubbly Water|1202} {i:Bubbly Water|Bubbly Water|1202}
** {q:Trial by Earth|Trial by Earth|Trial by Earth} ({p:Titan}): {@i:Desert Light|1205} {i:Desert Light|Desert Light|1205}
** {q:Trial by Lightning|Trial by Lightning|Trial by Lightning} ({p:Ramuh}): {@i:Elder Branch|1206} {i:Elder Branch|Elder Branch|1206}
** {q:Trial by Water|Trial by Water|Trial by Water} ({p:Leviathan}): {@i:Eye of Nept|1204} {i:Eye of Nept|Eye of Nept|1204}
** {q:The Moonlit Path|The Moonlit Path|The Moonlit Path} ({p:Fenrir}): {@i:Ancients' Key|1208} {i:Ancients' Key|Ancients' Key|1208}
* Return all seven items to {n:Mamaulabion} (the items must be traded one at a time and it is not necessary to turn in all seven at once).
* Wait until midnight (JST), then speak with {n:Mamaulabion} once more to receive the {@i:Evoker's Ring|14625} {i:Evoker's Ring|Evoker's Ring|14625}.

=2 Notes
* This quest is only repeatable if {@i:Evoker's Ring|14625} {i:Evoker's Ring|Evoker's Ring|14625} is dropped.

